{
  "name": "L22 · AI lead qualifier & router (Sales capstone)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🏁 L22 · Capstone: everything together\nForm → Gemini scores the lead (BANT) with **structured output** → **Switch** routes Hot / Warm / Cold → CRM sheet, instant sales alert, tailored reply.\nErrors → L19. Emails → could call L20a.",
